on is good, and it's clear you have a wide range of technical skills. However, consider tailoring this section to match the specific requirements of each job application.", 'ats_match': '75%', 'recommendations': ['Prioritize skills relevant to the specific job description.', 'Consider adding specific skills or technologies mentioned in the job posting.', 'Use keywords from the job description in the skills section.']}, {'title': 'Education', 'description': 'You have a well-structured education section, providing the necessary information about your degree and institution. However, consider adding relevant coursework or projects that demonstrate your skills and knowledge.', 'ats_match': '90%', 'recommendations': ['Highlight relevant coursework or projects that showcase your skills.', 'Consider mentioning any academic awards or honors.']}, {'title': 'Overall Resume Feedback', 'description': 'Overall, your resume is well-structured and provides a clear overview of your skills and experience. You have a strong track record of success and a passion for technology that is evident throughout your resume. By incorporating the recommendations above, you can further enhance your resume and increase your chances of securing your dream job.', 'ats_match': '80%', 'recommendations': ['Use a consistent format and style throughout the resume.', 'Proofread carefully for any grammatical errors or typos.', 'Consider using a professional resume template to improve the visual appeal of your resume.']}]}
