2024-09-02 13:51:03,184 - app - INFO - Analysis result: {'error': 'Failed to parse JSON response.', 'raw_response': '{"overall_feedback": "Olusegun, your resume showcases a strong foundation in software development, particularly in the fintech and AI domains. You have a diverse portfolio of projects and experiences, demonstrating your versatility and technical skills. However, some sections could be more tailored to specific job applications, and the resume could benefit from a more concise and impactful format.  \\n\\nOverall, you have a strong profile, and with some adjustments, your resume will be even more effective in capturing the attention of potential employers.", "feedback_cards": [{"ats_match": "75%", "title": "Summary", "description": "Your summary effectively highlights your passion for software development and your key areas of expertise. It mentions your experience with Java Spring Boot, Python Flask, and Flutter, which are popular frameworks in the industry. However, you could make it more impactful by quantifying your accomplishments and using action verbs to showcase your impact. For example, instead of saying \\"I\'m dedicated to solving real-world problems,\\" you could say \\"Successfully developed and deployed solutions that improved efficiency by X% and reduced costs by Y%.\\"", "recommendations": ["Quantify your achievements in the summary to highlight your impact. \\nUse strong action verbs to emphasize your skills and accomplishments. \\nTailor the summary to the specific job you are applying for, focusing on the skills and experiences most relevant to the role."]}, {"ats_match": "80%", "title": "Experience", "description": "This section demonstrates a breadth of experiences across various companies and roles, highlighting your diverse skillset. The descriptions are detailed and provide specific examples of your work.  However, they could be more concise and focused on quantifiable results.  \\n\\nYou demonstrate strong technical skills, including experience with Java Spring Boot, Python Flask, Flutter, APIs, Databases (Oracle), and AI.  Your leadership in project refactoring, integration of AI, and training/support demonstrates valuable soft skills.  \\n\\nThe bullet points are a bit lengthy and could benefit from a more concise and results-oriented approach. For example, instead of saying \\"Developed and deployed RESTful APIs...\\", you could say \\"Developed and deployed RESTful APIs for 7 banks, enabling them to extend product offerings and integrate with ACH and CTS systems, resulting in a X% increase in revenue.\\" \\n\\nYour involvement in building an AI chatbot for educating students on racial issues demonstrates your commitment to social responsibility, which is a valuable asset in today\'s job market.", "recommendations": ["Prioritize quantifiable results in each bullet point to demonstrate your impact. \\nUse bullet points with concise and impactful language. \\nConsider using a consistent format for bullet points to improve readability. \\nFor each experience, highlight the most relevant skills and achievements for the target job."]}, {"ats_match": "90%", "title": "Skills", "description": "You have a strong list of technical skills, including programming languages, frameworks, and tools.  The inclusion of both hard skills and soft skills (version control, documentation, training) is beneficial.   The skills section is well-organized and easy to read, allowing recruiters to quickly identify your qualifications.", "recommendations": ["Consider grouping skills into categories (e.g., Programming Languages, Frameworks, Tools, Soft Skills) to improve readability. \\nIf you have a large number of skills, consider listing the most relevant skills for each job application."]}, {"ats_match": "70%", "title": "Education", "description": "You have included your university degree, which is a relevant credential for most software development roles.  However, you could enhance this section by adding specific coursework or projects that demonstrate your technical abilities.", "recommendations": ["Consider adding relevant coursework or projects that showcase your technical skills and knowledge. \\nIf you have any certifications or relevant training programs, include them in this section."]}, {"ats_match": "65%", "title": "Lead Ambassador I4G CUCG", "description": "This section demonstrates your leadership and community involvement. However, it could be improved by adding specific achievements or outcomes of your work.  For example, \\"Organized hackathons that attracted X number of participants and resulted in Y projects.\\" ", "recommendations": ["Quantify your accomplishments and highlight the impact of your leadership role. \\nFocus on achievements that demonstrate your technical skills and leadership qualities."}\n]}\n'}
